Read AGENTS.md, DESIGN.md and brand/voice.md before any Red design work.
Red is a separate visual brand from Protect Line. Use Vesper Libre regular/bold, cream #fdf3e6, red #ce4b38, and copy ink #271d1d. Reuse supplied logos and artwork from assets/manifest.json. At most one mascot composition per page. Do not invent assets or product facts. Restricted pink/blue need explicit permission; internal layout work can proceed without repeated approval. Read brand/publication.md for dependencies before customer-facing release.
